{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9000_situation", "source_sha256": "f9587769ca7c5381105e2529737af108ee8390e9c4cf2c28d9588783ba22a012", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　開始前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9000_place", "source_sha256": "d4791fb11477fe30ba4df1a8faada2b28b2b8855f65e1a06166ed650c671fc94", "ja": "公園", "zh": "公园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9001_p", "source_sha256": "015dd38163881f0d54956271c11f0b01a876c4f60b088396867ef1524322d42a", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影が\n始まる。育のテーマは『地元系ギャル』なのだが……）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄开始了。育的主题是“本地系辣妹”，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9002_030iku", "source_sha256": "bf107ce75e376ea6c6040f7fd2be195b8805cff0278d5ba9c6677ec278671793", "ja": "「あんまり、なれなれしくしないで！」\n……う～ん。これだと、地元系じゃないかな？", "zh": "“别跟我套近乎！”\n……唔～。这样的话，是不是不太像当地辣妹呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9003_p", "source_sha256": "3f9d38f505d4b576fe6d3c13b98f0dcaaa56d83da4b83113f48b310ea7854bf2", "ja": "育、練習お疲れさま。頑張ってるな！", "zh": "育，练习辛苦了。很努力嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9004_030iku", "source_sha256": "30144a029471244d7a2cefd02f7665ec13e4da8fb416b390992f5f352d62eedf", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nあのね、あんまり思った感じにならなくて……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n那个……总觉得没能做出我想要的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9005_030iku", "source_sha256": "15b95f0aa47537506e064bf5dbc01d6ebea5644f107bb9f03350a55552173bdc", "ja": "ギャルの人なら会ったことあるし、なんとなくわかる\nんだけど……地元系ってどう表現したらいいと思う？", "zh": "辣妹类型的人我以前见过，所以大概能理解，\n但是……你觉得“本地风”该怎么表现才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9006_p", "source_sha256": "4aeec58fea5a0e717c8c2f992c756a8470f3685a4ce2966db3962e448345a34b", "ja": "地元系の部分か。それなら……。", "zh": "当地特色的部分啊。那样的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9007", "source_sha256": "7eb9d3abc042a12f6efda278d0c9df383a9bb45e5a3f0a60bd2527ff5ef7f9e8", "ja": "優しさを意識", "zh": "注重温柔", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9008", "source_sha256": "894a2a05a9f3d28c4ef633760f0ab504a8f67116b8acc6bc7808e191e8e75f21", "ja": "少しそっけなく", "zh": "稍微冷淡一点", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9200_p", "source_sha256": "ed446c349063094aef6d78b2029d192191310cca49e840a4d6ef4a711be7db9c", "ja": "優しさを意識してみたらどうかな？　地元が大好きで\n地元に住む人達も好きなことを言うと思うよ。", "zh": "试着多带点温柔的感觉怎么样？我想她应该会提起\n自己深爱着故乡，也很喜欢生活在故乡的人们哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9201_030iku", "source_sha256": "5bb6a1fd7add1d7acdc6659c0aa68f55380a0d917963073920f013fd11fabe00", "ja": "そっか……。住んでるところが大好きって気持ちなら\nわたしもわかるよ。だって、わたしも同じだもん！", "zh": "这样啊……如果是喜欢自己居住的地方这种心情，\n我也能理解哦。因为我也是一样的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9202_030iku", "source_sha256": "7fe6b79c64053955f24c817264b5e95036f8135108a79ff3d4b9a65cd49c135b", "ja": "「水くさいこと言わないで、困ってるならいつでも\n頼ってね！」……こんな感じかな？　えへへ、どう？", "zh": "“别这么见外，遇到困难随时都可以\n来依靠我哦！”……是这种感觉吗？嘿嘿，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9300_p", "source_sha256": "ed446c349063094aef6d78b2029d192191310cca49e840a4d6ef4a711be7db9c", "ja": "優しさを意識してみたらどうかな？　地元が大好きで\n地元に住む人達も好きなことを言うと思うよ。", "zh": "试着多带点温柔的感觉怎么样？我想她应该会提起\n自己深爱着故乡，也很喜欢生活在故乡的人们哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9301_030iku", "source_sha256": "1407068a03f34b43b534a159acf9b6a7188f916235eacfe0f042b6aa89b9da80", "ja": "たしかに、テーマにピッタリかも！　でも、じょうずに\nやらないと、ただのやさしい人になっちゃうよね。", "zh": "确实，可能和主题很契合！不过要是做得不好，就会变成一个单纯的老好人，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9302_030iku", "source_sha256": "e96aae3c2dd8f0b3499d026c21386a57ca2a617f8d8480866642946cb5b481ed", "ja": "{$P$}さん、もうちょっと\n練習してていい？　それで感想を聞かせてほしいの。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我能再练习\n一会儿吗？然后想听听你的感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9500_p", "source_sha256": "dc183b7c26453982aa73d9c27f63567fe3717a81f99986a1c77a2f71dcd64a1c", "ja": "えっと、少し冷たい感じなのかな……。地元が好き\nだからこそ、よそ者には、つい警戒しちゃうだろうし。", "zh": "那个，感觉是不是稍微有点冷淡啊……正因为深爱着\n家乡，所以面对外地人时，难免会有戒心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9501_030iku", "source_sha256": "334cbc31954bd9419017474a2924cec8f5f2a942ddb6b2b3785e8f6f9354afce", "ja": "それじゃあ、練習でやってた感じで合ってたんだね！\nよーし……さっきの続きやってみるから、見てて？", "zh": "这样看来，和练习时的感觉一样就对了呢！\n好——那我来试试刚才没做完的部分，你看着哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9502_030iku", "source_sha256": "229e396262edb48071bfdf67b82c6912ce54fdd61583ac21117b2cba2c80d050", "ja": "「よそ者に用なんかない。いいから、ほっといて！」\n……うん、これなら本番もだいじょうぶそう♪", "zh": "“对外人没什么好说的。行了，别管我！”\n……嗯，这样的话正式演出应该也没问题了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9600_p", "source_sha256": "dc183b7c26453982aa73d9c27f63567fe3717a81f99986a1c77a2f71dcd64a1c", "ja": "えっと、少し冷たい感じなのかな……。地元が好き\nだからこそ、よそ者には、つい警戒しちゃうだろうし。", "zh": "那个，感觉是不是稍微有点冷淡啊……正因为深爱着\n家乡，所以面对外地人时，难免会有戒心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9601_030iku", "source_sha256": "f279a75b43924a98592cd0490223319ff33115ab9573ca7ca1fcf7ae4c63aa8c", "ja": "そうだよね。わたしも、そう思ったんだけど……\n写真を見た人が、こわいって思わないかな～？", "zh": "是啊。我也是这么想的，不过……\n看了照片的人，会不会觉得害怕呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_9602_030iku", "source_sha256": "20b3d2c9cf515b52d2953653cf04af7fabb84960226adbe9477ed5589e6024d9", "ja": "わたしが悪い子だって思っちゃったら、どうしよう！？\nだいじょうぶかな、{$P$}さん～！", "zh": "要是觉得我是个坏孩子，该怎么办呀！？\n没问题吗，{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
